</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though now the meeting’s over, in Thy grace,</l><l>Thy presence never will from us depart;</l><l>But as the Spirit Thy sustaining strength</l><l>Thou wouldst in love unceasingly impart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, may Thy presence go with us, we pray,</l><l>To bear with us the burden on our heart</l><l>That every moment we Thyself enjoy,</l><l>Till in the coming meeting we take part.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
